643.docs:
Gets a cursor for `key0`. If `None`, then `key0` is not in the map. If `Some`,
then `key0` is in the map, and `key1` can be queried.

```rust
use zerovec::ZeroMap2d;

let mut map = ZeroMap2d::new();
map.insert(&1u32, "one", "foo");
